  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Social Protection Floor is improved through Assessment Based National Dialogue and promotion of maternity protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This CPO will support the constituents and other relevant partners in addressing the gaps in social protection coverage and enhancing the overall effectiveness of the social security system. Technical assistance will be provided in drafting a new social protection strategy guided by the principles of the relevant ILO conventions. 
From a gender and non-discrimination perspective the ILO will support advancing women&apos;s economic empowerment, reducing wage gaps, and promoting decent work for all building on the country&#x2019;s Gender Equality Strategy until 2030 and the National Action Plan on Gender Equality for 2022-2024.  With ratification of C190 by the Republic of Kyrgyzstan in 2024, ILO will intensify its efforts to support the tripartite constituents in full implementation of C190 through policy recommendations, capacity building and awareness raising on preventing and addressing violence and harassment in the world of work. The tripartite dialogue on the country assessment on investing in the care economy prepared by using the ILO Global Tool on Care Policy Investment on Simulator will be facilitated.</narrative>
  </description>
